      "body": "@dawibe5626 Note that this wasn't _our_ decision to implement the account requirement for MaxMind; we're trying to work around a restriction that was put upon us with very little notice.\r\n\r\nBecause license keys are standalone from the account that creates them, you can share license keys across multiple installations of AzuraCast. If you can't create an account yourself for whatever reason, you can always ask a friend to create a license key for you (or send you theirs).",
